# Public build settings for production/preview builds (committed on purpose: nothing here is secret).
# Google OAuth *Client ID* — public by design (Google and Supabase put it in every sign-in URL).
# It is the same Client ID configured in Supabase → Authentication → Google. NOT the client secret.
# A Vercel environment variable with the same name overrides this value.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=218049214761-0rlhaldldili60hqf76bo49hrecfhslp.apps.googleusercontent.com
